  "worked_solution": "We know that $\\text{dim(Null}(Q))$ is the number of non-pivot columns in $Q.$ \n\nSince $Q$ has $8$ columns and $5$ of them are pivots, then the number of non-pivot columns in $Q$ is \n\n$$\n8-5=3.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{dim(Null}(Q))=3.$",
